<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Land share trade to resume Wednesday.</title>
<headline>DBS Land share trade to resume Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property firm DBS Land Limited has asked the Stock Exchange of Singapore (SES) to lift the suspension of its share trading on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company announced earlier on Tuesday the placement of 91.9 million new shares at Singapore $4.75 each to raise net proceeds of about S$427.7 million.</p>
<p>Trade in its shares were suspended at the request of DBS Land pending the announcement.</p>
<p>The shares closed at S$5 on June 2.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
